# worker/.dev.vars.example — copy to worker/.dev.vars (gitignored) for `wrangler dev`.
# NEVER commit the real .dev.vars. Local-only secrets/overrides for the Worker.
# Nothing here is required for smoke tests (they inject a local SQLite D1 shim).

# Example (secrets go in the Cloudflare secret store, not this file):
# WEBHOOK_INGESTION_TOKEN=replace-with-your-local-test-token